tin ke rin’!","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Moged ngorad feni sorok!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Mu tang niged SOMOL ni bochan feni sorok ko pin’en ke rin’.","poem":1},{"text":"Muguyed rogon ngan rung’ag u ga’ngin e fayleng murung’agen.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Urngin e girdi’ nma par u Zion e nge tolul ngalang me tang!","poem":1},{"text":"Got nib thothup rok piyu Israel e ba sorok,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mma par u fithik’ e girdi’ rok.”","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yap_bsm/ISA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/ISA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/ISA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}